OL,3,ABomb threat forces Israel to Austria
OL,4,Aflight into emergency landing
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Austrian Airlines flight from Israel
OL,7,Fto Austria was forced to divert to
OL,8,FBulgaria after a reported bomb threat.
OL,10,FThe Airbus A320 plane was travelling
OL,11,Ffrom Tel Aviv to Vienna on Sunday night
OL,12,Fbut made an emergency landing in Sofia,
OL,13,Fwhere passengers were evacuated, the
OL,14,FBulgarian transport ministry said in a
OL,15,Fstatement.
OL,17,FThe Bulgarian air force scrambled a
OL,18,FMiG-29 fighter jet to escort the
OL,19,Fairliner, the statement said. No
OL,20,Finjuries have been reported and an
OL,21,Finvestigation has begun.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
