OL,3,ABomb threat forces Israel to Austria
OL,4,Aflight into emergency landing
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after a pilot attempted to
OL,7,Fhijack a Flydubai flight en route to
OL,8,FTel Aviv last month by attacking the
OL,9,Fcaptain, before the flight's crew and
OL,10,Fpassengers overpowered him and landed
OL,11,Fthe plane safely in Saudi Arabia.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
